1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,400
Every name has a story. Star in yours!

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:08,100
Many of us don't know where our surname comes from.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,800
Surname Saga turns that into an adventure. Just type your surname.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
An AI historian researches your name, with fun facts while you wait.

5
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:25,033
Meet the Origin File: what your name means, and how it's spelled across dialects.

6
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:30,233
Plus a timeline, from ancient China to Singapore today.

7
00:00:30,433 --> 00:00:35,733
Next, pick your heritage path: Hokkien, Teochew, or another branch.

8
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:39,133
Tell it where home is today, and start the comic.

9
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,900
A showrunner AI plans the whole saga, following real migration history.

10
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:48,367
You get a cover starring you, a mystery, and a cast of ancestors.

11
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:52,667
And a journey map, from Fujian in 1852 back home to Singapore.

12
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:56,367
A writer AI streams the script.

13
00:00:56,467 --> 00:00:59,767
An art director plans each page, and an illustrator paints it.

14
00:00:59,767 --> 00:01:03,767
Each page is drawn from the last, so faces stay consistent.

15
00:01:03,967 --> 00:01:08,967
The result: a comic of your family's journey, starring you.

16
00:01:09,167 --> 00:01:14,767
Kai finds a broken boat his family kept for generations.

17
00:01:14,967 --> 00:01:20,967
Then it pulls him back to Quanzhou in 1852, where he meets his ancestor.

18
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:26,100
Each chapter teaches real history, plus a word in Hokkien.

19
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:31,000
Then a pop quiz to check what you've learned.

20
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:36,500
And you decide what happens next: pick a path, or write your own twist.

21
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:41,100
The writer AI picks up the story right where you left off.

22
00:01:41,267 --> 00:01:47,367
Share your saga to the gallery, so family and friends can read it,

23
00:01:47,467 --> 00:01:55,267
and anyone can remix a saga to keep the story going their own way.

24
00:01:55,767 --> 00:01:59,667
Surname Saga. What's your story?

